 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_1e23c04a9d253b1eb60f",
   "sourceHash": "1e23c04a9d253b1eb60fb5112e8325ae428dfb34a54f9a0a517f24bceb2b3e83",
   "text": "有机护肤产品 为滋养、保护和焕活肌肤，该护肤系列包括一款保湿乳液、一款焕颜面部护理油，以及一款添加天然成分的草本面膜。这些产品温和而有效，适合所有肤质使用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_200708df9af02dbc263b",
   "sourceHash": "200708df9af02dbc263bd1fb3f0e5c73e296acd394560e906cd116e7fa7b3b33",
   "text": "有机护发方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_104bc64e41027c80dd25",
   "sourceHash": "104bc64e41027c80dd25e997aa4f21400d78c7f2c4c46bc24495112ea074a2f8",
   "text": "Kairali有机护发系列包括洗发水、护发油和护发素，可改善发质、减少头皮屑、促进头发生长，同时保持头皮的自然平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_61381b6e57e1e93bcb04",
   "sourceHash": "61381b6e57e1e93bcb04ebf68177e65c784ba3979715aa7054ab264168428797",
   "text": "有机护发方案 Kairali有机护发系列包括洗发水、护发油和护发素，可改善发质、减少头皮屑、促进头发生长，同时保持头皮的自然平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfe2b6099c4f7f1cbadc",
   "sourceHash": "bfe2b6099c4f7f1cbadceae5944540a04e13a6358ba44d1f6048dc3d6c9e2bc2",
   "text": "理疗油与药膏",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6749a7afbe88698a7e3f",
   "sourceHash": "6749a7afbe88698a7e3ff269c01f47398cf08724559f683e70d74196d8a2c491",
   "text": "这些理疗油和药膏融入阿育吠陀草药，旨在针对性地缓解疼痛、炎症和僵硬。这些产品非常适合日常护理和按摩治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ebae24a32698f87640ce",
   "sourceHash": "ebae24a32698f87640ce055d79a294bf39be84c36853b6752dee360e78521168",
   "text": "理疗油与药膏 这些理疗油和药膏融入阿育吠陀草药，旨在针对性地缓解疼痛、炎症和僵硬。这些产品非常适合日常护理和按摩治疗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4baaf95e3d0d7fc65997",
   "sourceHash": "4baaf95e3d0d7fc65997f12f45525d93dab0e00daa9b4dd79e2c1be6b70d9706",
   "text": "有机养生茶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1c778b8a6b135b0e1f96",
   "sourceHash": "1c778b8a6b135b0e1f96963b820e5931d604cbc9fc7e767723faaf25484a5bcf",
   "text": "这一系列草本茶旨在带来多种健康益处，包括增强免疫力、帮助放松和舒缓消化。这些茶以有机草药和香料制成，带来焕活身心、促进健康的饮用体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_96b806c2b0b74bfe6887",
   "sourceHash": "96b806c2b0b74bfe68878f7c3fe69c0a256e0b7d21d71724113f0a0acd74ca6b",
   "text": "有机养生茶 这一系列草本茶旨在带来多种健康益处，包括增强免疫力、帮助放松和舒缓消化。这些茶以有机草药和香料制成，带来焕活身心、促进健康的饮用体验。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_93db3b13ce904292100f",
   "sourceHash": "93db3b13ce904292100f8a2187d62282b870d36322091d048165feb5ca5c9f0c",
   "text": "以阿育吠陀专业知识精心打造",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c70276688ed09b12c7c4",
   "sourceHash": "c70276688ed09b12c7c431e4b2e3f3593f78a544c6df195ec221ea377fc2da4b",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀专利有机产品中的每一款，都是在阿育吠陀从业者的知识指导下，经过多年研究与开发的成果。这些独有配方以传统阿育吠陀方剂为基础，因此每一款产品都凝聚了古老疗法的精髓。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_10d234b859afb566cef0",
   "sourceHash": "10d234b859afb566cef0b152b214745a6c14e0951c602ec66fda55375f951676",
   "text": "可持续发展与道德实践",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_662641fbf4c0ba1b2276",
   "sourceHash": "662641fbf4c0ba1b2276f9c33a6ada14f588fe1b52492d8bca93d372756dc076",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀专利有机产品在生产的各个环节都重视环境责任。从以负责任的方式采购原材料，到采用环保包装，企业确保其各项活动与环境相协调。此外，企业倡导合乎道德的贸易做法，并与当地社区密切合作，推动可持续农业和公平就业。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Glossary term 'From' (出发地) not applied: here 'From' is part of a 'from…to' construction, not the travel-origin label."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ce09de98b127c9f2ccef",
   "sourceHash": "ce09de98b127c9f2ccef9e8837b5f5d309d12595fc77661d2faa15aa1ed74a52",
   "text": "选择有机产品的好处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_82365bc4ac587e51dd44",
   "sourceHash": "82365bc4ac587e51dd44c33f6a73c65e7aa74a4a957d8d2683566fa42991fd84",
   "text": "Kairali阿育吠陀专利有机产品带来诸多好处：",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6de500285081057cbfe8",
   "sourceHash": "6de500285081057cbfe8f13a6f25dd53427a0593ab562932f1d668a4b7d3f993",
   "text": "纯净与安全",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_05be319fb44c70205465",
   "sourceHash": "05be319fb44c7020546595cd1d32b77f4779c2bbbcea0ca1852b281475626cfd",
   "text": "：这些产品不含人工化学物质或添加剂，对环境和人体健康都安全。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5737c3aead1fb4a552df",
   "sourceHash": "5737c3aead1fb4a552df8660151deb03e5393f51e51153c6c8090f541227a58f",
   "text": "纯净与安全：这些产品不含人工化学物质或添加剂，对环境和人体健康都安全。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8808343988942f341084",
   "sourceHash": "8808343988942f341084d49d73be5fa9a58ccb0a0efe613419910e2be87ce2ba",
   "text": "整体身心健康",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
